{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A NEW FRE CHAPTER IS NOW AVAILABLE! EXPERIENCE THE EPILOGUE.\u00a0<br><br> Named <u>one of the best VR horror experiences available</u> by <i>UploadVR, this is the</i>\u00a0Deluxe Complete Series with enhanced graphics &amp; animations, upgraded movement controls and Index controller support.  Just keep telling yourself &quot;it's only VR&quot;.\u00a0 Get it now before Steam Frame!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note the supported headsets for best results.  If you own a Quest 2, Quest Pro, Quest 3, Pico 4,  etc. please purchase from the respective stores as those control schemes are not officially supported.</strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exorcism of the Legion (Last Rites) features support for tracked controllers,  \u201cteleport&quot; and \u201cfree roam\u201d locomotion options, and a variety of other highly customizable movement settings accessed via your in-game mobile phone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic, sinister and completely immersive environments hide rich story clues and a variety of unique secrets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and use a several trademark exorcism tools as well as hidden \u201cartifacts\u201d to upgrade your instruments. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive cryptic messages from a mysterious stranger who seems to know your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the safety of your office at the end of every chapter to assess your performance and progress to the subsequent chapter. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156250/extras/f81f4d9f4c4614a1e868dcadc7995838.poster.avif?t=1776362569\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto